        "## Exercises"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "1. Read Agno's docs. Port the stdlib ReAct loop (Lesson 01) to Agno. What disappeared? What stayed?\n2. Read Mastra's docs. Port the same loop to Mastra. What changed in tool typing (Zod vs nothing)?\n3. Benchmark: measure agent instantiation latency on your stack. Does Agno's 2\u03bcs matter to your workload?\n4. Design a migration: if you've been running CrewAI in Python, what breaks if you move to Agno?\n5. Read Mastra's `ee/` license terms. What restrictions would affect an open-source fork?"
      ]
    }
